{
  "$comment": "What Marvi can install. Data, not code \u2014 adding a component means adding an entry here. Voice models live in voice-models.json until the PowerShell installers are retired, because duplicating their hashes is how two files drift apart.",
  "schema": 1,
  "components": [
    {
